OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a rather frosty start to
OL,6,FFriday, it will be dry with plenty of
OL,7,Fsunshine through the day. Feeling
OL,8,Fchilly with below average temperatures
OL,9,Fand light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOvernight it turns cloudier
OL,12,Fwith clear intervals, but a cold night
OL,13,Fahead with widespread frost forming by
OL,14,Fdawn. Winds will become breezier in
OL,15,Fthe southwest.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FSaturday will be a dry day
OL,18,Ffor most with temperatures recovering
OL,19,Fslightly, but still below average.
OL,20,FOvernight, rain and stronger winds
OL,21,Farrive in Cornwall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
