OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,6,Fwill be wet and windy for many, with a
OL,7,Fdrier interlude on Monday before more
OL,8,Fpersistent rain on Tuesday.
OL,9,FTemperatures close to or just below
OL,10,Fthe average.
